(7418889, 1170416, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jomari:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations, Anita. Lovely work as always. Remember when we had little bottles of milk distributed in class? Maybe not. I''m probably showing my age. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes absolutely, this was inspired from my early school days, where they use to deliver the bottles to our classrooms, I use to love the cream on the top, funny you don''t get that anymore since milk was tampered with.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-11-27 01:05:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by jomari: Congratulations, Anita. Lovely work as always. Remember when we had little bottles of milk distributed in class? Maybe not. I''m probably showing my age.   Yes absolutely, this was inspired from my early school days, where they use to deliver the bottles to our classrooms, I use to love the cream on the top, funny you don''t get that anymore since milk was tampered with.', '2015-11-27 00:48:25.000000', '2015-11-27 01:05:08.000000', 0),
