(7419626, 1170432, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a little brighter, but otherwise, I think it''s great. I''m not sure why it''s so low in the pack, gross factor maybe? I really don''t think it''s gross though. Now, if the teeth were nasty or something it would be gross, but those are some fine teeth. Maybe it''s the tongue... Bah, it should have scored better.</td>', 'I think this could have been a little brighter, but otherwise, I think it''s great. I''m not sure why it''s so low in the pack, gross factor maybe? I really don''t think it''s gross though. Now, if the teeth were nasty or something it would be gross, but those are some fine teeth. Maybe it''s the tongue... Bah, it should have scored better.', '2015-12-01 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
